21.11.2026 09:29:10 [Notification] Handling Console Command /doctor mod automaticclayformer
21.11.2026 09:29:10 [Notification] == Automatic Clay Former ==
• Automatic Clay Former 2.4.0, by demonic69, prescko, rekimchuk13
  Mod id automaticclayformer; Code mod; runs on: Universal; file automaticclayformer_2.4.0.zip
  Hold clay near a clay form with a recipe selected and it shapes itself. Uses clay exactly like forming by hand. Range and speed are configurable with /clayformer (/clayformer help lists the commands)
  Its website (https://github.com/Comp-any/Automatic-Clay-Former-) Find Automatic Clay Former on the Mod DB (https://mods.vintagestory.at/list/mod?text=Automatic%20Clay%20Former)
✓ Everything it needs is there (1).
  The game: wants 1.22.0 or newer, this is 1.22.7
✖ The config file AutomaticClayFormerServer.json can't be read
  Unexpected end of content while loading JObject. Path 'AllowAutomaticForming', line 2, position 0.
  The file isn't valid JSON any more (a missing comma or bracket after editing by hand, most often). The mod it belongs to then starts with its defaults, or fails to start.
  Move AutomaticClayFormerServer.json aside so a fresh one is written (/doctor fix doctor:reset-config AutomaticClayFormerServer.json)
• It changes the game's code in 1 place(s), 0 of them shared with other mods
  BlockEntityClayForm.OnUseOver
  Mods patch the game's own code where it offers no other way in. It is normal, but it is also what breaks first when the game updates, and two mods patching the same place can get in each other's way.

