== Errors and warnings from Automatic Clay Former ==
⚠ Automatic Clay Former: Automatic Clay Former couldn't read the server's settings file, so automatic forming is allowed
  [Automatic Clay Former] Could not read ModConfig/AutomaticClayFormerServer.json, using default settings: Unexpected end when deserializing object. Path 'AllowAutomaticForming', line 2, position 0.
  ModConfig/AutomaticClayFormerServer.json isn't valid JSON, so the server uses the default (automatic forming allowed) until it's fixed.
  → Fix the file, or start it afresh: the mod writes a new one with the default settings at the next start.
  Start the settings file afresh (/doctor fix automaticclayformer:server-config-unreadable/fix)
